#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:3
#: 0417a507b943450d95e7bfc430c85441
msgid "晶格扰动（Lattice Perturb）"
msgstr "Lattice Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:5
#: 2243a5273a11437db47c40ce6c09a6f1
msgid "`Group`: `Lattice` | `Class`: `CellScalingCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:7
#: 77fc4041dd5c4dbcbb555fc7216dc011
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:9
#: ed5eb01b2e1e433dbd3ab0a71bd3e901
msgid "对晶胞尺度和角度做轻量随机扰动，为近平衡态补充几何变化样本。每个输出结构在原始晶格基础上引入独立随机的长度缩放和（可选的）角度缩放。"
msgstr ""
"Apply small random changes to cell lengths and, optionally, cell angles to "
"sample geometry near equilibrium. Every output receives an independent "
"perturbation of the original lattice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:11
#: 92e9ad2feaea4524936326605cc0b81b
msgid "f_k\\in[1-m,1+m],\\quad a_i'=f_i a_i,\\quad \\theta_j'=g_j\\theta_j"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:13
#: 0a318c774b3841c783ace5ccf31fde65
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:15
#: d13b8bf2baaa4c09946dc56094a73a52
msgid "场景：模型预测热膨胀系数偏差超过 30%"
msgstr "Scenario: Thermal expansion is wrong by more than 30%"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:17
#: 26a5d67ffdd5477f9022a1e5896d763c
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，弛豫态的能量和力精度都过关，但用准谐近似算出来的热膨胀系数比实验值大了 "
"30%。诊断发现：训练集里所有结构都处在同一平衡体积，模型对体积轻微变化时的能量梯度完全是外推出来的——外推不准。"
msgstr ""
"A Si NEP has acceptable energy and force errors at relaxed structures, yet a"
" quasiharmonic calculation overestimates thermal expansion by 30%. Every "
"training structure has the same equilibrium volume, so energy gradients "
"under small volume changes are extrapolated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:19
#: b4f23a3fd6c04887bb6875826b38759c
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"热膨胀系数取决于声子频率对体积的导数，归根结底需要模型在平衡体积附近有足够的体积-能量采样点。纯静态弛豫结构只有一个体积，不够。解决办法是围绕平衡晶格随机生成一批稍微膨胀或收缩的结构，用少量白噪声覆盖近邻体积空间。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Thermal expansion depends on volume derivatives of phonon "
"frequencies, which requires adequate volume-energy sampling around "
"equilibrium. A single relaxed volume is insufficient. Add modest random "
"contractions and expansions around the equilibrium lattice to cover the "
"nearby cell space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:21
#: 9663d3a772004f15ac0c1074f0be1521
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Si 单胞"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed Si unit cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:23
#: 1598a1564ea0474494a0551d35246e37
msgid "**目标：** 围绕平衡体积生成 30 个随机晶格扰动的结构，缩放幅度 4%，覆盖 ±4% 的体积范围"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Generate 30 random lattice variants around equilibrium with a"
" 4% scaling amplitude."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:25
#: 96b4f8c99b444d21b0b9f52e390165ad
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:26
#: 4795173f1ff242c49bca51485d3558a0
msgid "`max_scaling` = `0.04` （4% 缩放幅度）"
msgstr "`max_scaling` = `0.04` (4% scaling amplitude)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:27
#: 21a44c7b9fa7453cb8d333d9dc73c018
msgid "`max_num` = `30`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:28
#: b9476d4db09a4e4599e0beae7d6dd988
msgid "`perturb_angle` = `false` （先只看长度变化，避免角度扰动混入）"
msgstr "`perturb_angle` = `false` (isolate length changes first)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:30
#: 5fa2faff530943ae9e010dd7b4997b93
msgid "**输出：** 30 个结构，每个的晶格长度在原始值的 96%~104% 之间随机分布，原子分数坐标随晶格同步缩放"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Thirty structures whose lattice lengths are sampled between 96% "
"and 104% of the input values, with atoms following the cell at fixed "
"fractional coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:32
#: 9c6ae6f1ed5b47feb8bbd0c1cfc0d73f
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:33
#: f4fecc46efbc42e58eb9e92a6a388b4c
msgid "重训后重新跑准谐近似计算热膨胀系数，应更接近实验值"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, repeat the quasiharmonic calculation; thermal expansion "
"should move closer to experiment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:34
#: 7aa80459004f44049e30571b412f3684
msgid "检查输出结构的体积分布直方图：应均匀覆盖 [V*(1-0.04), V*(1+0.04)]，不要在两端堆积"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the output volume histogram. It should cover the intended "
"neighborhood without strong endpoint clustering."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:35
#: 663e00570f4444f7aedd273c61a29824
msgid "如果改善不够，增大 `max_scaling` 到 0.06~0.08，同时换 Sobol 引擎覆盖更均匀"
msgstr ""
"If coverage remains insufficient, increase `max_scaling` toward 0.06-0.08 "
"and consider the Sobol engine for a more even small-sample design."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:36
#: 3ae39a356f57480faf9d2bdd113ec20f
msgid "抽查最短键长：如果 4% 缩放后最短键比 DFT 参考键长短了 > 0.2 Å，说明缩放过大，回调 `max_scaling`"
msgstr ""
"Spot-check nearest-neighbor distances. If a 4% perturbation shortens a bond "
"by more than 0.2 Å relative to the DFT reference, reduce `max_scaling`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:38
#: fcff631c411548e98bab29e3c0d2443a
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:40
#: a3567becefec4a048581852c0176bbe7
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:41
#: ec06460c96104b8ea8737b136a491e9b
msgid "模型对体积变化敏感，体积-能量曲线或热膨胀相关性质偏差大"
msgstr ""
"Volume-sensitive predictions, the volume-energy curve, or thermal-expansion "
"properties are inaccurate"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:42
#: c2042607a683468786cd9983c9299cea
msgid "训练集中所有结构体积过于集中，缺少近平衡体积散布"
msgstr ""
"Training volumes are concentrated at one value with no near-equilibrium "
"spread"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:43
#: 2a89096cd84140babdd638f1e8b029c6
msgid "需要模型在 ±5% 体积范围内有内插能力"
msgstr "The model needs interpolation coverage over modest volume changes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:45
#: 8439113b963b4e0080506dd7340fb58d
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:46
#: c2a0586b9d8449aaaf36adca38c45b63
msgid "只需要特定方向、特定幅度的应变 → 用 `Lattice Strain` 更精确控制"
msgstr ""
"A specific direction and strain magnitude are required; use `Lattice Strain`"
" for controlled scanning"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:47
#: 316f6484bda94aff89a02e6041b6879e
msgid "体系本身刚度极大、体积变化无物理意义（如高压相），扰动只产生无意义结构"
msgstr ""
"Volume changes are outside the intended physical regime, for example a "
"tightly constrained high-pressure phase"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:48
#: b9d35088540f4e7cb03442fffe4a95e7
msgid "输入结构含有机分子但没开 `identify_organic` —— 分子内键会被错误拉伸"
msgstr ""
"The input contains molecules but `identify_organic` is disabled, which would"
" distort intramolecular bonds"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:50
#: 00445d63f7f7445588c39343b9e9ab32
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:52
#: 95a2cd3bfadb4739aa0635b30c7cb231
msgid "Engine Type（engine_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:54
#: ec7f0e1ecac048f2b54dba73e7ce7cf1
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。`0` = Sobol 准随机序列，`1` = Uniform 均匀随机。Sobol 在少量样本（< "
"20）时覆盖明显更均匀，Uniform 则生成更快。样本数上到 50 以后两者差异很小，选哪个都行。如果你只跑十几个结构，优先 Sobol。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. `0` selects a Sobol low-discrepancy sequence and `1` "
"uniform random sampling. Sobol gives more even coverage for fewer than about"
" 20 samples; uniform sampling is simpler and differences diminish around 50 "
"samples. Prefer Sobol for a small design."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:56
#: 7ea9316167f4438b9ddc018a97042175
msgid "Max Scaling（max_scaling）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:58
#: bfd3a5ad4034482c8b22102be72569dd
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.04`。晶格长度的随机缩放幅度系数 `m`，实际长度会在 `[1-m, 1+m]` 范围内均匀采样。如果同时开启了 "
"`perturb_angle`，角度也在这个相对范围内同步缩放。0.01~0.03 适合补近平衡声子区；推到 0.04~0.06 覆盖热膨胀；设到 "
"0.08 以上时务必抽查最近邻距离，防止出现非物理键长。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.04`. Lattice lengths are sampled with factors in `[1-m, "
"1+m]`. With `perturb_angle`, angles receive the same relative scaling. "
"Values around 0.01-0.03 target near-equilibrium phonon sampling, while "
"0.04-0.06 broadens thermal-expansion coverage. Above 0.08, inspect nearest-"
"neighbor distances for nonphysical bonds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:60
#: 6f67f82341794db492f61256c059f195
msgid "Max Num（max_num）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:62
#: cede72f3db28494295df461807452d29
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 50。每个输入结构生成多少个扰动版本。注意这不是晶格方向数——是输出结构的数量。20~30 个足够覆盖 ±4% 体积空间的 3D "
"长度自由度；50~100 个适用于同时扰动角度的 6D 空间。这里是随机采样而不是系统网格，增大这个值提高的是覆盖密度，不是覆盖范围。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `50`. Number of perturbed outputs per input, not the number "
"of lattice directions. Roughly 20-30 samples can cover three length degrees "
"of freedom at modest amplitude; 50-100 are more appropriate when angles "
"expand the space to six dimensions. Increasing the count raises density, not"
" range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:64
#: dfc507454e2b4bf590b1b381b13dfbc0
msgid "Perturb Angle（perturb_angle）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:66
#: 641481410ddc4ea7bcfb12f5ab2f7b1d
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 "
"`true`。打开后晶格角度（alpha/beta/gamma）也跟着一起随机缩放——注意这是乘性缩放（原始角度乘以一个随机因子），不是加性偏移。非正交晶格体系（单斜、三斜）建议保持打开；正交或更高对称的晶系可以先关掉，长度覆盖够用以后再开。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Randomly scale alpha, beta, and gamma as well as "
"lengths. This is multiplicative, not an additive angular offset. It is "
"useful for monoclinic or triclinic cells; for orthogonal or higher-symmetry "
"cells, begin with it disabled and add angle coverage only when needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:68
#: 6fb6b9d407174c3489b0016e30868572
msgid "Identify Organic（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:70
#: 6a0267cdb0aa42ad935b34be1d26046a
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 "
"`false`。打开后程序识别有机分子团簇，扰动时团簇做刚性整体移动，分子内键长不参与缩放。分子晶体（MOF、有机半导体）必须开，否则晶格缩放会直接把分子内键拉断。纯无机体系关着省计算。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Detect molecular clusters and move each "
"approximately as a rigid body so intramolecular bonds are not scaled. Enable"
" for molecular crystals, MOFs, and organic semiconductors; leave disabled "
"for purely inorganic systems."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:72
#: d4daa2c0f6954a8584f010138cd8f474
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:74
#: a3865ba16f374f8996ec017577c91bab
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。打开后每次同一输入 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed "
"得到完全相同的扰动结果。做对比实验或需要复现的时候打开，纯探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable to reproduce perturbations from the same "
"input, parameters, and seed. Use it for controlled comparisons; exploratory "
"generation may leave it disabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:76
#: e6996562b4854cfc92eb53898989d4a0
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:78
#: 2841bdd03df241ce9789e259ec19430e
msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值，仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。两个不同的 seed 会产生两组不同的扰动分布。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Random seed used only when `use_seed` is enabled. "
"Different seeds produce different perturbation designs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:80
#: 28365b08311c42f582d760d0e4e2b5ec
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:82
#: d0a0a72abe8342e5a0af896c91353729
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:84
#: fe1062f360964d82a3421564ad4f3d36
msgid "近平衡声子覆盖（max_scaling=2%，仅长度，Sobol）"
msgstr "Near-equilibrium phonon coverage (2% length-only scaling with Sobol)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:85
#: fc864d64e4914912aaa8088f6010690f
