"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:118
#: 7d8addb0263047f79cc39b3aaa942bdf
msgid "大范围探索（max_scaling=8%，100 样本，含有机保护）"
msgstr "Broad exploration (8%, 100 samples, molecular protection enabled)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:119
#: 31bff982d9d34873b8b694ef01720259
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellScalingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_scaling\": 0.08,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 100,\n"
"    \"perturb_angle\": true,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:135
#: 7aaeebd8e73c4aa5943b495bf73899e3
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:137
#: caf9fadc1b60489c87dbe5954700332c
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Lattice Perturb`：先系统扫特定方向应变，再补充随机近邻散布"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Lattice Perturb`: scan controlled directional strains, "
"then add random local coverage"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:138
#: 3af85519d180449b9f247dacf2295051
msgid "`Lattice Perturb` → `Atomic Perturb`：晶格扰动后再加原子级坐标噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Perturb` -> `Atomic Perturb`: perturb the cell before adding atom-"
"level coordinate noise"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:139
#: 4e4022cf1f3a4a5eb26a90d4e0b8c9a0
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Lattice Perturb`：扩胞后在更大尺度上做晶格扰动"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Lattice Perturb`: expand the structure before perturbing "
"its cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:141
#: d6dd08aaf7fc4f409d82e8ec1ef9957d
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:143
#: 0b9dcb53fe274f998447fedb3fef9a36
msgid ""
"**输出全是相同结构或分布极窄。** `max_scaling` 是否太小（如 0.001）？或者 `max_num` 太小导致偶然均匀。先增大 "
"`max_scaling` 到 0.02 以上，增大 `max_num` 到 20 以上。"
msgstr ""
"**Outputs are identical or cover an extremely narrow range.** Check whether "
"`max_scaling` or `max_num` is too small. As a diagnostic, try `max_scaling` "
"of at least 0.02 and `max_num` of at least 20."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:145
#: 32946ff062b4497983939bcfb383a04b
msgid "**分子晶体输出中键被拉断。** `identify_organic` 没开。对于 MOF、有机晶体等，必须开启此开关，否则晶格缩放会直接拉伸分子内键。"
msgstr ""
"**Bonds break in a molecular crystal.** Enable `identify_organic`; otherwise"
" cell scaling directly distorts intramolecular geometry."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:147
#: 552b9a2b2dbb408baef21b8384a9f09c
msgid ""
"**角度扰动后结构角度变化不符合预期。** 注意此卡的角度扰动是乘性缩放（原始角度乘以随机因子），不是加性偏移。如果原始角度是 90 "
"度、`max_scaling=0.04`，新角度在 86.4~93.6 度之间。"
msgstr ""
"**Angle changes differ from expectation.** The card multiplies each angle by"
" a random factor rather than adding an offset. At 90 degrees with "
"`max_scaling=0.04`, the range is 86.4-93.6 degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:149
#: 2850f6d940de4c0093057c63db61d818
msgid ""
"**Sobol 和 Uniform 输出差异大。** `max_num` 较小时（< 20）Sobol 覆盖明显更均匀。样本数 ≥ 50 "
"后两者差异缩小。如果在意复现性，固定 `engine_type` + `use_seed`。"
msgstr ""
"**Sobol and uniform outputs differ strongly.** This is expected for fewer "
"than about 20 samples, where Sobol is more even. Differences shrink around "
"50 samples. For reproducibility, fix both `engine_type` and the seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:151
#: 1830c5de878d43fc9cd4a1a35ddd5c42
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:153
#: 893d131dd0064b17bc19faa6228aa5c9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`LSc(max={max_scaling},{U|S})` —— `U` 表示 Uniform，`S` 表示 Sobol。"
msgstr "`LSc(max={max_scaling},{U|S})`, where `U` means uniform and `S` means Sobol."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:155
#: 15c1a538bf644261ad17c32123cccab9
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:157
#: faa88e1cbab5434eb1e90c80726175e6
msgid ""
"勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。注意 Sobol 引擎的 scramble 也受 seed 控制，给定 seed"
" 后序列完全确定。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce an input. The seed also "
"controls Sobol scrambling, so the sequence is deterministic once set."
